cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this course in teaching, research, or training, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "Pandas, Clearly: Pandas for Data Science"
abstract: >-
  A free practical course that starts with Python values and dictionaries and
  develops pandas skills through guided examples, predictions, explanations,
  code changes, debugging, and independent data-analysis tasks. Includes a
  browser classroom, student notebooks, worked solutions, and teaching notes.
